<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 65 mln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 65 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction July 29 versus July 22  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   168/175		349/356</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.13/3.14	    3.46/3.46</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.14/3.14	    3.46/3.46</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.13/3.14	    3.46/3.45</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million    35/70		 30/732</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million     35/361		50/870</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,823 million markka, the STO said. @</p>
<p>STO had said it would issue at most 800 million markka worth of T-Bills in Tuesday's auction.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
